SUMMARY:Summer Art Camp | Storybook Art (Rising K – 2nd grade)
DESCRIPTION:JOIN THE WAITLIST \nDiscover the importance of illustrations in a variety of storybooks then create art in the style of each illustrator.  We’ll use a wide range of art mediums for each project as well as create a book of your own!  \nMeet the Instructor: M Rathsack\nM Rathsack\, owner and instructor at M’s School of Art\, has taught many mediums in many locations for all ages in Western North Carolina since 2006. She creates her own art as the Dancing Potter working primarily as a decorative raku potter. 
