SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds: Lo Wolf
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a live performance by Lo Wolf\, local harpist. \nABOUT THE MUSICIAN\nCaptivated at an early age by this incredible instrument\, Lo has a unique and improvisational style honed by years of study in the classical and Celtic modes. She brings her singer-songwriter sensibilities to bear and draws on the world around her to create soothing and memorable soundscapes that reflect the beauty she sees. Performances will take place July 5\, 19th\, and August 2. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
