SUMMARY:Third Thursday
DESCRIPTION:Every Third Thursday\, the Museum comes alive with an evening filled with music\, tours\, art making\, special cocktails in our rooftop café\, and more! \nThis month we are featuring a Curator’s Talk | Hidden in Plain View – Art in Southern Appalachia\, with Co-creator of Warp\, Weft and the Grid\, Kathleen Curtis Wilson from 6-7pm. \nRESERVE TICKETS NOW
